## PRIVACY INVARIANT: raw pixels/audio must never be committable, anywhere in the
## tree. These extensions are blocked globally as defense-in-depth (the egress
## guard + test enforce the same rule in code). Do NOT add negations for these.
*.mov
*.MOV
*.mp4
*.m4v
*.mkv
*.avi
*.heic
*.HEIC
*.wav
*.mp3
*.aac
*.caf
*.m4a
*.mlmodelc/
*.mlpackage/
## Note: still-image frames from capture live under data/ (ignored above);
## .jpg/.png are NOT globally blocked so genuine UI assets stay trackable.

## Local harness / IDE state (worktrees, launch config, local settings)
.claude/

## Archived corrupt object store (forensic only) + legacy dead-code data
archive/git-corrupt-*/
trace_hub/data/

## Cockpit runtime state (pids, locks, heartbeats, jsonl logs, rescore
## checkpoints) — written continuously by background processes; not source.
## The rest of ops/ (ROADMAP, NORTH_STAR, workorders) stays tracked.
ops/cockpit/

## iCloud/Finder conflict copies, e.g. "README 2.md", "Makefile 2". This repo
## lives in an iCloud-synced ~/Documents, which generates these and can corrupt
## .git — never let them be committed. (Proper fix: move the repo out of iCloud.)
* [0-9].*
* [0-9]

# local secrets (frontier text-egress key, never committed)
.secrets/

# never commit bundled model weights (GBs)
trace-native-fastvlm/FastVLM/model/*.safetensors
models/**/*.safetensors

# day-in-life demo build artifacts (large / regenerable)
evaluation/day_in_life/*.sqlite3
evaluation/day_in_life/*.sqlite3-*

